---
/**
 * PUBLIC_INTERFACE
 * About section describing the person and values.
 */
---
<section id="about" class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header">
      <span class="section-eyebrow">About</span>
      <h2 class="section-title">A bit about me</h2>
      <p class="section-subtitle">Engineer with a passion for crafting robust systems, clean APIs, and polished product experiences.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="grid grid-2">
      <div class="card" style="padding:1.1rem;">
        <h3>Background</h3>
        <p class="muted">
          I’ve worked across startups and enterprises, leading frontend platforms, building design systems, and
          delivering end-to-end features from roadmap to production using Agile practices.
        </p>
        <div class="spacer-sm"></div>
        <ul class="muted">
          <li>TypeScript, React, Astro, Node.js</li>
          <li>REST, GraphQL, CI/CD, Docker, Cloud</li>
          <li>Accessibility, performance, testing</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="card" style="padding:1.1rem;">
        <h3>Values</h3>
        <p class="muted">
          I value clarity, empathy, and craftsmanship. I love pairing with designers and product to
          create experiences that feel effortless and perform beautifully.
        </p>
        <div class="spacer-sm"></div>
        <div class="skills">
          <span class="skill">UX Collaboration</span>
          <span class="skill">DX & Tooling</span>
          <span class="skill">System Design</span>
          <span class="skill">Mentorship</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
